      "text": "1. check whether email is present in db\n   or not if not then throw error\n\n2. Verify password if not matched then\n    throw an error  (do not use sensitive data for payload)\n\n3. generate a token based on a payload\n    --> payload is a user data who is trying to login.\n\n4. sebd this token to client's browser(cookies, req.header)\n\n5. logged in successfull.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. check whether email is present in db\n   or not if not then throw error\n\n2. Verify password if not matched then\n    throw an error  (do not use sensitive data for payload)\n\n3. generate a token based on a payload\n    --> payload is a user data who is trying to login.\n\n4. sebd this token to client's browser(cookies, req.header)\n\n5. logged in successfull.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
