      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Check for token first if not found \n    throw error (Please login first)\n \n2) if token is present then decode the token\n\n3) after decoding we should get the same payload\n    {name: \"Avinash\"}\n\n4) If token mismatched then throw an error\n\n5) next()  ----> req forward controller",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Check for token first if not found \n    throw error (Please login first)\n \n2) if token is present then decode the token\n\n3) after decoding we should get the same payload\n    {name: \"Avinash\"}\n\n4) If token mismatched then throw an error\n\n5) next()  ----> req forward controller",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
